        "original_id": "2d06c62a-88b1-50a2-a38c-0758a583b91c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Freederm\n- Companies: Diomed Developments Limited\n- Concepts: Nicotinamide, niacinamide\n- Topics: acne medication, skin care medication, dietary supplements, vitamins\n\nFacts:\n- Freederm is a UK brand of acne and skin care medication manufactured by Diomed Developments Limited.\n- Freederm products include nicotinamide as an active ingredient.\n- Diomed Developments Limited claims that nicotinamide in Freederm is clinically proven to help get rid of inflamed red spots.\n- Nicotinamide, also known as niacinamide and NAA, is a vitamin found in food.\n- Nicotinamide is used as a dietary supplement and as a medication.",
